TEXT 32 32 Left 2 ;#223 Six-transistor Gilbert cell
TEXT 32 72 Left 2 ;Source: Alan Wolke (W2AEW), https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7nmmb0pqTU0
TEXT 32 112 Left 2 ;The lower pair steers current through a cross-connected upper quad, multiplying two differential inputs.
TEXT 32 1168 Left 2 ;10 kHz and 500 Hz, 50 mV peak drives are illustrative; Alan does not specify exact generator settings.
TEXT 32 1216 Left 2 !.tran 0 36m 20m 1u
TEXT 32 1360 Left 2 !.options plotwinsize=0
TEXT 32 1264 Left 2 !.meas tran VOUT_PP PP V(col_a,col_b) FROM 22m TO 34m
TEXT 32 1312 Left 2 ;The 16 ms saved window holds a whole number of cycles of both tones, so an FFT of it needs no window function.
